        "original_id": "89efa3af-f8e9-5ff4-b3ae-d799773fc331",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: 21 Savage, Metro Boomin\n- Products: The Slaughter Tape, Slaughter King, Free Guwop, Savage Mode, Issa Album, Bank Account\n- Places: Atlanta, Georgia\n- Companies: Slaughter Gang, Epic Records\n\nFacts:\n- Shayaa Bin Abraham-Joseph was born on October 22, 1992, and is better known by the stage name 21 Savage.\n- 21 Savage is an American rapper from Atlanta, Georgia.\n- Before releasing his debut album, 21 Savage was best known for the mixtapes The Slaughter Tape and Slaughter King and the extended plays Free Guwop and Savage Mode with Metro Boomin.\n- Issa Album is the debut studio album by 21 Savage.\n- Bank Account was the lead single from Issa Album.\n- Issa Album was released on July 7, 2017, by Slaughter Gang and Epic Records.",
